  "implementation": [
    "One QFile::readAll capture, fresh Qt path size/date observations, no native identity layer or retry.",
    "Two in-memory stages: trusted complete Bento1/OMF1 foundations, then qualified values and direct relationships. Phase-only shared Cancel checks.",
    "Owned file/master lists, complete binary MobIds, all qualified owners retained, valid report-local master indices.",
    "Original rate/audio representations retained. Exact audio conversion uses bounded unsigned64 fractions temporarily.",
    "Local failures preserve independent qualified values; shared unsafe foundations return no salvaged catalogue prefix.",
    "Known format/unit context is independent of the six-tag Kind display rule. MPGA/JPED keep qualified timing while Kind stays Unknown.",
    "Complete earlier audio format values survive later unrelated chunk damage with an explanation; damaged or conflicting required claims withhold dependent values.",
    "No production parser or OldScanner library dependency. Only existing immutable MacRoman table reused."
  ],
