    "Project key/owner priority, exact keys, fixed MacRoman, marked Unicode, strict UTF-8, conflicting same-object values, immediate-source agreement and conflicts.",
    "Optional catalogue index membership/legacy identity agreement, unknown used dictionary names, missing required component links, local malformed typed fields.",
    "Zero length, original rate encoding, audio source variants, full unsigned32 WAVE frequency, complete AIFF80 significand and unsigned64 fraction boundaries.",
    "WAVE/AIFF summary damage boundaries, independent repeated-format conflicts, unsupported standard WAVE versus extensible container width.",
    "Qualified DNx special depth codes, unrelated coding rejection, separate RGBA arrays and incompatible component layouts.",
    "DF bit0 independent of other low/high flag bits, direct and immediate source paths, required numbering damage, known NDF clocks.",
    "Unknown Kind retains known descriptor timing, optional precompute details preserve Type, genuine catalogue counts and pinned audio fields."
